    "progressSummary": "COMPLETED: verified (0 axioms, 0 sorries) extraction of the per-step residue law E(N)=E(⌈N/4⌉)+δ(N mod 8) as a reusable lemma, with bounds/dictionary and the sustainability obstruction (residue 7 → even quotient ⟹ −5 cannot chain; residue 6 chains ⟹ rate 4). Documented that the exact Θ(log N) constant remains a genuinely harder open sub-question."
